#. :src: bpy.types.WM_OT_read_factory_settings.use_empty
#. :src: bpy.types.WM_OT_read_homefile.use_empty
msgid ""
"After loading, remove everything except scenes, windows, and workspaces. "
"This makes it possible to load the startup file with its scene configuration "
"and window layout intact, but no objects, materials, animations, ..."
msgstr ""
"Efter laddningen tas allt bort utom scener, fönster och arbetsytor. På så "
"sätt kan startfilen laddas med scenkonfigurationen och fönsterlayouten "
"intakt, men utan objekt, material, animationer osv."

